<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>성적 조회</title><%- include("partials/subject_style") %></head>
<body><main>
  <p class="eyebrow">SUBJECT / READ</p><h1>성적 기록</h1><p class="intro">과목과 점수를 데이터베이스에서 조회합니다.</p>
  <section class="panel"><table><thead><tr><th>ID</th><th>과목</th><th>점수</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    <% if (subjects.length === 0) { %><tr><td colspan="3" class="empty">등록된 성적이 없습니다.</td></tr><% } %>
    <% subjects.forEach(function (item) { %><tr><td><%= item.id %></td><td><%= item.subject %></td><td class="score"><%= item.score %>점</td></tr><% }); %>
  </tbody></table></section>
</main></body></html>
